Event Management System

## 📘 Overview
The **Event Management System** is a Java-based desktop application designed to simplify the process of creating, storing, and managing event details.  
It uses **Object-Oriented Programming (OOP)** principles and integrates **JavaFX**, **JDBC**, and **MySQL** to deliver a complete event organization platform.

The system automates event record handling, ensures data accuracy, and provides a modern GUI interface — making event creation and tracking efficient and user-friendly.

